CORE no-new-smt
unequal.c

^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ a\[2\] and b\[2\] may differ: FAILURE$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ a\[2\] and b\[2\] may be equal: FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Arrays that differ in a single element are not equal, and the solver must be
able to produce a model in either case.
